rId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":42677906,"text":"#おやおや、これはこれは、{NICKNAME}にパイモンじゃないですか？","nextNodeIds":[740650102,740650103]},{"nodeId":740650102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2987686698,"text":"仲良かったっけ？","nextNodeIds":[740650104]},{"nodeId":740650104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":182858698,"text":"そう冷たくしないでください。この間のことは、しっかりと胸に刻んでいるんですから。","nextNodeIds":[740650105]},{"nodeId":740650105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3585258786,"text":"この間のことって…あっ！まだ聞きたいことがあったのに、聞けなかったんだよな！","nextNodeIds":[740650106]},{"nodeId":740650106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":345369786,"text":"そ、そうでしたっけ？私の記憶にはないのですが…何のことでしょう？まったく思い出せません。","nextNodeIds":[740650107]},{"nodeId":740650107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":1273099106,"text":"過去を振り返るより、未来に目を向けたほうが良いと、賢い方は口を揃えて言います。ですから、今後の協力の話でもしようじゃありませんか！","nextNodeIds":[740650108]},{"nodeId":740650108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":1687659290,"text":"実は今、報酬の悪くない仕事がいくつかありまして…ただ、手伝ってくれる人がおらず困っているんです。お二人とも、もしお時間がありましたらやってみませんか？","nextNodeIds":[740650109]},{"nodeId":740650109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2181104594,"text":"ふん、また簡単に騙されると思うなよ…","nextNodeIds":[740650110]},{"nodeId":740650110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":432751554,"text":"報酬が悪くないって？","nextNodeIds":[740650111]},{"nodeId":740650111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4226266338,"text":"おいっ！","nextNodeIds":[740650112]},{"nodeId":740650112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":1020173042,"text":"#ははっ、私が{NICKNAME}みたいな方と取引したい理由が、これで分かったでしょう？そう、まさにノリがいいからです！","nextNodeIds":[740650113]},{"nodeId":740650113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":742396778,"text":"さて、さっそくですが報酬を提示しましょう。絶対にご満足いただけると思いますよ。","nextNodeIds":[740650114]},{"nodeId":740650114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":2532085802,"text":"特別許可券百枚——どうでしょう？","nextNodeIds":[740650115]},{"nodeId":740650115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2343228738,"text":"百枚！？","nextNodeIds":[740650116]},{"nodeId":740650116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":646097922,"text":"ふむ、その様子からして、私の太っ腹具合に感動したみたいですね。","nextNodeIds":[740650117,740650119]},{"nodeId":740650117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":165265354,"text":"フォンタの栓を買うこともできない。","nextNodeIds":[740650118]},{"nodeId":740650118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3794289154,"text":"そうだ、そうだ！よくそんなこと言えるな、信じられないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[740650121]},{"nodeId":740650121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":2382114194,"text":"これでも太っ腹じゃないと言うのですか？君たち若者はまったく…いい加減にしてほしいものですね。","nextNodeIds":[740650122]},{"nodeId":740650122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":3204399298,"text":"こんな楽に稼げる仕事、貧乏人たちはみんな我先にと群がるのに…","nextNodeIds":[740650123]},{"nodeId":740650123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":643235562,"text":"デサンブル！やっと見つけたぞ！以前、郵便室の近くで自分の仕事を安値で新入りに下請けさせてたな？","nextNodeIds":[740650124]},{"nodeId":740650124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":1328726090,"text":"#ん？{NICKNAME}にパイモン？まさか、こいつのデタラメを信じたんじゃないよな？","nextNodeIds":[740650125,740650127]},{"nodeId":740650125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1601285522,"text":"うっ、もう騙されたあと…","nextNodeIds":[740650126]},{"nodeId":740650126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":3375241122,"text":"はぁ、遅かったか。","nextNodeIds":[740650130]},{"nodeId":740650130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":2863014130,"text":"とにかく、こいつの言うことは信じないでくれ。こいつはメロピデ要塞に入ったばかりの者や、しばらく経ってはいるもののルールを知らないやつを選んで騙してるんだ。これまでにかなりの数の被害が出てる。","nextNodeIds":[740650131]},{"nodeId":740650131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":1048991282,"text":"騙すだなんて…人聞きが悪いですね。それに君だって、私と大して違わないでしょう？ほら、看守たちも特別許可券を使って、雑務をやらせてるじゃないですか…","nextNodeIds":[740650132]},{"nodeId":740650132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":3407675490,"text":"オレたちは、その一部を自分の懐に入れるなんてことはしない。","nextNodeIds":[740650133]},{"nodeId":740650133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21095,"speakerName":"デサンブル","textMapHash":1805730970,"text":"まったく、何が言いたいんですか？証拠もなしに言いがかりをつけるなんて…","nextNodeIds":[740650134]},{"nodeId":740650134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":3495056010,"text":"ふん、証拠が見たいんだな？なら、ついてこい。反省室は静かで広いし、資料を読むには打ってつけだぞ。…ったく、ジオード鉱坑道にはまだトラブルが残ってるってのに…","nextNodeIds":[740650135]},{"nodeId":740650135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":1637956826,"text":"#そうだ。{NICKNAME}、パイモン、もしよかったら手伝ってくれないか…","nextNodeIds":[740650136]},{"nodeId":740650136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":643545986,"text":"オイラたち、別にいつも暇してるわけじゃないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[740650137]},{"nodeId":740650137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1772912642,"text":"報酬をいっぱい貰えるんでしょ？手伝うよ。","nextNodeIds":[740650138]},{"nodeId":740650138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4060094226,"text":"おいっ！","nextNodeIds":[740650139]},{"nodeId":740650139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":3503572642,"text":"ハハッ、もちろん規定通り支払うぞ。お前らも相場は分かってるだろ。俺はごまかしたりしないから安心しろ。","nextNodeIds":[740650140]},{"nodeId":740650140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":1376553338,"text":"実はだな、ジオード鉱坑道に原海アベラントがうろついてるんだ…放っておくと危ないし、早く処理しなくちゃならない。","nextNodeIds":[740650141]},{"nodeId":740650141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":2281208858,"text":"オレはまず、こいつを反省室まで連れて行く。そこで同僚に引き渡しの手続きをするんだが、ちょっとばかし時間がかかる…それが済んだら、すぐお前らと合流しよう。","nextNodeIds":[740650142]},{"nodeId":740650142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1341060810,"text":"おう、あんまり遅くなるなよ。","nextNodeIds":[740650143]},{"nodeId":740650143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":3019589338,"text":"ああ、できるだけ早くしよう。ただ手続きだからな…早く済むかどうかはオレが決められることじゃない。じゃ、そっちはお前らに任せたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740650127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2052264154,"text":"今回はまだだよ。","nextNodeIds":[740650128]},{"nodeId":740650128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"マポワ","textMapHash":214345082,"text":"今回は？","nextNodeIds":[740650129]},{"nodeId":740650129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3990519794,"text":"えーと…前にいろいろあって…","nextNodeIds":[740650130]},{"nodeId":740650119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2606325962,"text":"#百枚で仕事を斡旋すれば、{M#俺}{F#私}だって儲かる。","nextNodeIds":[740650120]},{"nodeId":740650120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4106394786,"text":"うわっ、まさかそれがおまえの目的なんじゃないよな！","nextNodeIds":[740650121]},{"nodeId":740650103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4146834418,"text":"なんか嫌な予感…","nextNodeIds":[740650104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7406501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE